# CV source PDFs — these carry personal contact details and, more importantly,
# referees' direct emails and mobile numbers. This repo is public, so keeping
# them untracked matters even though _config.yml also excludes them from the
# built site: committing them would expose the files on github.com regardless
# of whether Jekyll publishes them.
CV_*.pdf

# Concatenated full text of published papers, kept locally as a reference for
# maintaining _data/publications.yml. Includes publisher-typeset versions
# (e.g. the Elsevier Hexpo article) that should not be redistributed.
All_Publications.md
